{{wikipedia}}

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|ar|en}} {{m|ar|شَهَادَة||witnessing}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{hyphenation|sha|ha|da|lang=en}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|-|s|shahadat}}

# {{context|Islam|especially|theosophy|lang=en}} The [[Islamic]] [[declaration]] of [[belief]] in the unity of God and the prophethood of Mohammed, one of the [[five pillars]], the formal content of which is the [[kalima]] (a [[minimal]] Islamic [[creed]]).

